      "answer": "KGMU mein OPD appointment lene ke liye, aapko online registration karna hoga. Aap yeh tareeke istemal kar sakte hain:\n\n1.  **Website:** www.ors.gov.in (mobile internet ke through)\n2.  **Phone:** 0522-2258880 ya 0522-3539333 par call karein.\n3.  **SMS:** \"APPOINTMENT <NAME>\" likhkar 8887019134 par bhejein.\n\nYadi aap 2 March ke liye appointment lena chahte hain, toh upar diye gaye tareekon mein se kisi ka bhi prayog kar sakte hain. Kripya yaad rakhein ki online registration anivarya hai.",
